Inclusion Criteria:

* Age 1-12 years,
* ASA I-II grade;
* selective adenotonsillectomy
* BMI 18.5～23.9,
* Sign informed consent

Exclusion Criteria:

* Emergency surgery;
* Abnormal liver and kidney function
* severe dehydration and malnutrition or Hb \< 10g/dl;
* BMI \<18.5 or \<23.9;
* Children with neurological disorders
